{"id":"n66307-2-8","stage":1,"title":"왕 · 王","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66307-2-8-1","ko":"우리 부서에서 너보다 술 잘 마시는 사람이 있을까?","zh":"我们部门里会有比你更能喝酒的人吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부서에서","meaning":"部门","explanation":"부서：部门；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"부서","audio":"/audio/57bcfb6e119961a2aa23.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26317","senseId":"1","lemma":"부서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너보다","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"술","meaning":"酒","explanation":"술：酒","readings":[{"term":"술","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65157","senseId":"1","lemma":"술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，熟练地","explanation":"잘：很好地，熟练地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마시는","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있을까?","meaning":"可能","explanation":"있다：可能；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"6","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"57bcfb6e119961a2","term":"부서","zh":"部门","audio":"/audio/57bcfb6e119961a2aa23.mp3","entryId":"26317","definition":"公司、机关、组织中按照工作的性质分成的多个业务单位。","pronunciation":["부서"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"803d2c68651cecea","term":"술","zh":"酒","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3","entryId":"65157","definition":"像啤酒或烧酒等那样含有酒精成分、喝后会醉的饮料。","pronunciation":["술"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，熟练地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"熟悉而擅长地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"可能","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"存在发生某种状况的可能性或实为如此。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/fb48b55eb4b24a6ce992.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66307-2-8-2","ko":"아니, 술 마시는 데는 내가 왕이지.","zh":"不会的，喝酒这方面我可是王牌啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니,","meaning":"不，没","explanation":"아니：不，没","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65980","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"술","meaning":"酒","explanation":"술：酒","readings":[{"term":"술","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65157","senseId"